url: "https://sebastianfoerste.github.io/legal-function-operating-system/"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic, tested rules for an in-house legal function: intake, risk,
  priority, routing, service levels, approval tiers, external-counsel decisions,
  escalation and a board-ready pack, with an Art. 28(3) GDPR clause-coverage
  check. No language model is in the decision path, and all bundled data is
  synthetic.
keywords:
  - legal operations
  - legal intake
  - legal front door
  - legal engineering
  - approval matrix
  - GDPR
  - DSGVO
